{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bc1452d2627f4fc6ed78d8b2add27d9fb40c526ae545b0e8debe3d63252eb83e", "ja": "莉緒、お疲れ様。\n衣装のフィッティングはどんな感じだ？", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦了。\n服装试穿感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "d38ea88acbf498debe1f61bc03ffc78568444eac4bbe328e4d6f94093876e44f", "ja": "{$P$}くん！？　もう来たの！？\nちょ、ちょっと待って、まだ心の準備が……！", "zh": "{$P$}君！？已经来了吗！？\n等、等一下，我还没做好心理准备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1002_p", "source_sha256": "db29df27dd2cedc74190589fbff25b6ab00039d37b908894918d04aac18297da", "ja": "準備……？　なかなか呼びに来ないから心配したんだ。\nしかし、莉緒によく似合……。", "zh": "准备……？因为你一直没来叫我，我都担心了。\n不过，莉绪穿这身很合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "fdf53eff08e7cac105614828ec11e995f9b2c443bc1a8db3df4b4e9315ba8137", "ja": "ストップストーーーーーーーーップ！\n一旦そこまで！　まだなにも言わないで～っ！？", "zh": "停——停——停——停——！\n先到这里！暂时什么都别说～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "826e58559b0c4c0ff4959da8d28ca2ddf3896ce11e67667e327f3ce6cab5e20a", "ja": "えーと……ちょっと、そこで待っててね……！", "zh": "那个……你先在那儿等一下哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1006_p", "source_sha256": "66ef6c735e888f8fb51d7366911853dde4c798d7bcff2ebded9090a39b10f8f7", "ja": "莉緒……？", "zh": "莉绪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "3318a7008a32af01c647cc7a87b9b0b391e107c67c0fac9721e5b8560495c931", "ja": "前髪よし。メイクよし、衣装も……だ、大丈夫なはず、\nよね？　すう、はあ、すう……心の準備もよし。", "zh": "刘海，没问题。妆容没问题，服装也……应、应该没问题，  \n对吧？吸气，呼气，吸气……心理准备也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "d4dc88b755e4477c478a2552d6b7ee69ab3a777903a4ab226aae247d3f4425cd", "ja": "お待たせ～！\nさあ、{$P$}くん、感想をどうぞ！", "zh": "让你久等啦～！\n来，{$P$}，请说说感想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a49b5a1a2533f3a843a85b77fd5f15b5b25d8a2f58065c69ba444f28ed8657a4", "ja": "……どうぞと言われても、言いにくいんだが。\nその前に、どうした？　なんか不安そうに見えるけど。", "zh": "……你让我说，可这实在有点难开口。\n不过在那之前，怎么了？看起来好像有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "fcb866a86b8072681842b384b775af779d747ab29875ec4a09d043f2ce09031c", "ja": "うっ……。やっぱり、\n{$P$}くんにはわかっちゃうのね。", "zh": "呜……果然还是被{$P$}看出来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1011_p", "source_sha256": "45e0012d299bd45dae858998620e5a055236a6117cdc5ba0fdee8c5d5f3abe62", "ja": "ハッ！　もしかして、衣装になにか問題が？\nそれなら詳しい話を……。", "zh": "哈！难道是服装出了什么问题？\n那我来详细了解一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "4753cfb62def5538f93b37b78533be4b05521db75680b3741d2153d45b613fa7", "ja": "逆よ逆！　とっても大人っぽくてハイグレードで\n私も自分にぴったりの衣装だと思ってるわ。でも……。", "zh": "反了反了！这套服装特别成熟、高档，我也觉得非常适合自己。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "ab45cce21139a2e0fbdf7b56f05f39c3f7ff5c12d8cfad1e74ab4b3aecc38090", "ja": "もし、{$P$}くんに\nダメ出しとかされたら……私……。", "zh": "要是被{$P$}\n挑出毛病来的话……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "4b0aeb4b8115148dfef82547ca53ea70ffaecda5da5234bc571cb4d461234ee8", "ja": "ううう～、自分でもわかってるわよ～！\n今の私、すーっごく子どもっぽいって！", "zh": "呜呜呜～，我自己也清楚啦～！\n现在的我，超——级像个小孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "8b52f2456ad9e953e5a3ebb4793d48feeade38e4ee308b86133a7d1135d8002e", "ja": "でも、仕方ないじゃない……。\n乙女心は、とっても繊細なんだから～！", "zh": "可是，没办法嘛……。\n少女心可是非常纤细的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3bd622f6ad7470c932b0c31de32db577b051caf6e3ffbfb47f6ba72d05173d03", "ja": "わ、わかってるよ……一応、わかってるつもりだ！\nとりあえず、少し落ち着こう。", "zh": "我、我知道啦……姑且算是明白的！\n总之，先稍微冷静一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0b781246761745799042c9fe746dbe57a278bf18aa240a4137880eb349e93368", "ja": "コホン……。えっと、俺が言おうとしたのは、\nいつもと違う雰囲気で、莉緒に似合ってるってことだ。", "zh": "咳咳……呃，我想说的是，\n虽然和平时的感觉不同，但很适合莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "1480cb7583d29905ecfd52f3ef905cc01641699d9c2df50c83f46ce1e90914e4", "ja": "ホント？　本当にそう思ってる……？\n肌も出てないし、セクシーに見えるかしら？", "zh": "真的？你真的这么觉得……？我也没露什么肌肤，这样看起来会性感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8690032af97894602603d8104a047afa787a56518ab488789c5ae7edb63c5141", "ja": "ああ。そもそも、肌を出すだけがセクシーじゃないって\nこのみさんもよく言ってるだろう？", "zh": "是啊。说到底，性感又不只是露出肌肤，这个道理可可美小姐也经常说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a6604a5b992705bdce9260c406c10d8babc2f89819bf89fe52f69272bf5f10a8", "ja": "それに、スタイルに自信のある莉緒だからこそ\n着こなせる衣装だと思うよ。", "zh": "而且，我觉得正因为莉绪对自己的身材有自信，才能驾驭这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "14f942e72e5bb90952e345d08025010b2ed5d93d0b4236f2f74760e5ddd2f596", "ja": "あ、あら……{$P$}くんったら\n言うじゃない、もう～……うふふっ♪", "zh": "啊、哎呀……{$P$}君真会说话，真是的～……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0634_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "96588b9997c4208965e07aae2809d2dc4a540d2a6954026e06a1167a44a8996a", "ja": "あっ。最後にもう一度確認するんだけど……\nほんとーに、もっと露出しなくて大丈夫なのよね？", "zh": "啊。最后我再确认一下……\n真的、不用再多露一点也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
